{"id":"ff346ee0085d8f22","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete.md","title":"Kripke Incompleteness of Henkin Logic","display":"thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete — Kripke Incompleteness of Henkin Logic","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete","aliases":["89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete"],"display":"thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete — Kripke Incompleteness of Henkin Logic","depends_on":["[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]","[[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]]","[[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]","[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]","[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-valid-modal]]","[[89-df-4-axiom]]","[[89-df-gl-logic]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete — Kripke Incompleteness of Henkin Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b9ec54437321db8d\" href=\"?note=b9ec54437321db8d\" title=\"89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model\">89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a504f38ba12874d6\" href=\"?note=a504f38ba12874d6\" title=\"89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence\">89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5ed2b55b4cca2b52\" href=\"?note=5ed2b55b4cca2b52\" title=\"89-df-henkin-modal-logic\">89-df-henkin-modal-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dbba58e7bd3b0667\" href=\"?note=dbba58e7bd3b0667\" title=\"89-df-valid-modal\">89-df-valid-modal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"883bfda9f28cc5ea\" href=\"?note=883bfda9f28cc5ea\" title=\"89-df-4-axiom\">89-df-4-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=(W,R)\">\\(F=(W,R)\\)</span> 为 Kripke 框架，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H,\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm H,\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为上述定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}\\)</span> 为传递且逆良基框架谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}incomplete}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm H\\ (F\\models A)]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F),\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box p\\to\\Box\\Box p)\\notin\\mathrm H,\\qquad\n\\mathrm H\\subsetneq\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}incomplete}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm H\\ (F\\models A)]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F),\\\\\n&amp;(\\Box p\\to\\Box\\Box p)\\notin\\mathrm H,\\qquad\n\\mathrm H\\subsetneq\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a504f38ba12874d6\" href=\"?note=a504f38ba12874d6\" title=\"89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence\">89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence</a>，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b9ec54437321db8d\" href=\"?note=b9ec54437321db8d\" title=\"89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model\">89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model</a> 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^*\">\\(2^*\\)</span> 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"e2ade50b86346886\" href=\"?note=e2ade50b86346886\" title=\"89-lem-l-implies-4\">89-lem-l-implies-4</a> 又给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"4\\in\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(4\\in\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span>，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-l-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-l-implies-4]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model","status":"resolved","id":"b9ec54437321db8d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"a504f38ba12874d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-henkin-modal-logic","status":"resolved","id":"5ed2b55b4cca2b52","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-valid-modal","status":"resolved","id":"dbba58e7bd3b0667","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-valid-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-4-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"883bfda9f28cc5ea","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence","status":"resolved","id":"a504f38ba12874d6","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 [[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 $2^*$ 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 $\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}$；[[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 又给出 $4\\in\\mathrm{GL}$，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。","embed":false},{"target":"89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model","status":"resolved","id":"b9ec54437321db8d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 [[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 $2^*$ 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 $\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}$；[[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 又给出 $4\\in\\mathrm{GL}$，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-l-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"e2ade50b86346886","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：Boolos, *The Logic of Provability*，第 11 章，印刷页 148–154；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n由 [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]]，框架验证 H 当且仅当它是 GL 框架：在全赋值语义下，单字母 Henkin 公式的有效性也验证全部替换实例，MP 与必然化保框架有效性。由 [[89-ex-cresswell-henkin-model]] 的固定赋值模型，H 的全部定理在所有世界为真，但 4 在 $2^*$ 为假，故 4 不属于 H。GL 由 Löb 公理验证全部 Henkin 实例，因而 $\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}$；[[89-lem-l-implies-4]] 又给出 $4\\in\\mathrm{GL}$，得到严格包含。任何验证 H 的框架类都会验证 4，因此不能完整刻画 H。模型有效性和框架有效性在此分别量化，不能互换。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm H,\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}kripke\\text{-}incomplete}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&[\\forall A\\in\\mathrm H\\ (F\\models A)]\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(F),\\\\\n&(\\Box p\\to\\Box\\Box p)\\notin\\mathrm H,\\qquad\n\\mathrm H\\subsetneq\\mathrm{GL}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm H\\subseteq\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"4\\in\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":1889,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-174","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-henkin-modal-logic]] → [[89-lem-henkin-frame-correspondence]] → [[89-thm-henkin-kripke-incomplete]]"}],"outgoing":["e2ade50b86346886","b9ec54437321db8d","a504f38ba12874d6","5ed2b55b4cca2b52","c6ab46cd662b1409","dbba58e7bd3b0667","883bfda9f28cc5ea","0006800fa1c85177"]}